1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,965
A produce buyer funds one route.

2
00:00:01,965 --> 00:00:05,832
A carrier gets paid for each crate the receiving dock accepts.

3
00:00:05,832 --> 00:00:10,650
This recorded local run shows the same Solidity contract packaged
for Aevum.

4
00:00:10,650 --> 00:00:13,135
The buyer locks four point five test units.

5
00:00:13,135 --> 00:00:14,318
The carrier is fixed.

6
00:00:14,318 --> 00:00:17,690
The station and payment agent have different signing keys.

7
00:00:17,690 --> 00:00:22,245
Each crate earns one eighth of a unit, with at most twelve crates
per ticket.

8
00:00:22,245 --> 00:00:24,009
The station accepts six crates.

9
00:00:24,009 --> 00:00:27,715
The measured range is two point four to six point seven degrees.

10
00:00:27,715 --> 00:00:32,537
The agent checks the signed report against the permitted two to
eight degree range.

11
00:00:32,537 --> 00:00:35,125
The quoted freight is zero point seven five.

12
00:00:35,125 --> 00:00:42,033
The contract checks both signatures and the lot identifier, then
transfers seven hundred fifty thousand base units.

13
00:00:42,033 --> 00:00:47,305
A separate verifier checks the token event, the canonical block,
and the signed ticket.

14
00:00:47,305 --> 00:00:50,015
The next load reaches ten point three degrees.

15
00:00:50,015 --> 00:00:51,761
It exceeds the agreed ceiling.

16
00:00:51,761 --> 00:00:54,651
The agent calls the contract to check the ticket.

17
00:00:54,651 --> 00:00:58,445
The check rejects the load before any transaction is broadcast.

18
00:00:58,445 --> 00:01:01,670
Now the station retries the first signed receipt.

19
00:01:01,670 --> 00:01:03,685
The lot is already marked paid.

20
00:01:03,685 --> 00:01:05,432
No second transfer is sent.

21
00:01:05,432 --> 00:01:09,530
The carrier keeps exactly the original zero point seven five.

22
00:01:09,530 --> 00:01:11,217
The buyer revokes the route.

23
00:01:11,217 --> 00:01:15,528
Three point seven five returns to the buyer, and escrow falls to
zero.

24
00:01:15,528 --> 00:01:18,839
The original payment remains independently verifiable.

25
00:01:18,839 --> 00:01:23,650
The archive includes the signed evidence and a command to
reproduce this run.
